# GUAM00GUM_R_20251000000_01D_30S_MO.crx.gz

Dataset: gps-raw — Raw GPS pseudoranges of 34 IGS stations on 2025-04-10 (BKG open archive):
  positions solved from the origin, satellites tracked
File: data/gps/raw/GUAM00GUM_R_20251000000_01D_30S_MO.crx.gz
SHA-256: 761d752d505b5c36a11e1ee2b8ce88284f54839996420486a73e4152038be0ed (also in
  data/gps/inputs.lock; check with: cd data/gps && sha256sum -c inputs.lock)
In the public repository: no, only this description and the hash: the file may be shared but is kept
